rlin"] ", the 1969 European Champion."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Kazakov won another World title in 1973 but retired in 1975. Veil never appeared on the podium at any other major international tournament. Björlin was competing in his third Olympics, winning his first medal."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Round Eliminated"] [:th {} "Bad Points"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "371"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/60485"} "Rustem Kazakov"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/URS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/URS.png"}] "URS"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "125"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/58446"} "Hans-Jürgen Veil"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRG"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRG.png"}] "FRG"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "72"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/57870"} "Risto Björlin"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FIN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FIN.png"}] "FIN"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {:class "bib"} "160"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/58674"} "János Varga"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/HUN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/HUN.png"}] "HUN"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [